      "title": "Model link",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Report workflow issue\n\nIf you found any issues when running this workflow, [report them here](https://github.com/ChenDarYen/NitroFusion2/issues)\n\n## Model links\n\n- [Hugging Face:ChenDY/NitroFusion2](https://huggingface.co/ChenDY/NitroFusion2)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen_3_4b.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors) (7.49 GB)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [nf2-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ChenDY/NitroFusion2/resolve/main/nf2-bf16.safetensors) (12.3 GB)\n\n**loras**\n\n- [nf2-dedistill-lora.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/ChenDY/NitroFusion2/resolve/main/nf2-dedistill-lora.safetensors) (381.6 MB)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [ae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ae.safetensors) (319.8 MB)\n\nTwo steps on one shared sigma table (euler, simple, shift 6). The de-distillation LoRA scale is set per step in the main block (default 0.5 on step 1, 0 on step 2). Keep cfg = 1.\n\nThe LoRA is loaded with **Load LoRA (Bypass, PR #17408, Model Only)** from [ComfyUI-BypassLoRA](https://github.com/ChenDarYen/ComfyUI-BypassLoRA), which applies it without merging it into the weights, so changing the scale between steps costs nothing (2-step generation is 1.5–3.5× faster). Install it with `git clone https://github.com/ChenDarYen/ComfyUI-BypassLoRA` in `ComfyUI/custom_nodes`, or with Install via Git URL in ComfyUI-Manager.\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │      └── qwen_3_4b.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │      └── nf2-bf16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 loras/\n│   │      └── nf2-dedistill-lora.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│          └── ae.safetensors\n```\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
